### Listar usuários do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/users?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Convidar usuário
POST {{base_url}}/api/users/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria@tenant.com",
  "group_id": "{{group_id}}"
}

### Remover usuário do tenant
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

###

### Criar grupo de permissão
POST {{base_url}}/api/permission-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Atendimento",
  "descricao": "Equipe de atendimento ao lead",
  "permissoes": ["view_conversations", "view_leads", "move_leads"]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("group_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Listar grupos de permissão
GET {{base_url}}/api/permission-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Editar grupo
PUT {{base_url}}/api/permission-groups/{{group_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Atendimento Senior",
  "permissoes": ["view_conversations", "view_leads", "move_leads", "view_automations"]
}

###

### Configurar perfil de visualização do grupo
PUT {{base_url}}/api/permission-groups/{{group_id}}/view-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "funnel_id": "{{funnel_id}}",
  "colunas_visiveis": ["col_id_1", "col_id_2", "col_id_3"]
}

###

### Configurar load balance do grupo
PUT {{base_url}}/api/permission-groups/{{group_id}}/load-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ativo": true,
  "algoritmo": "round_robin",
  "funnel_id": "{{funnel_id}}"
}

### Reatribuir lead manualmente
PUT {{base_url}}/api/leads/{{lead_id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}"
}
